A gaghị agbanwe faịlụ sava na-agba ọsọ.

A na-ebupụ Synix n'enweghị nsogbu na:

{0}

Synix paswọọdụ echekwara na Discord webhooks nwere ike weghachite na ọhụrụ PC na a nyefe paswọọdụ. Debe ya na faịlụ ahụ; a pụghị iweghachite ya.

Synix e exported ka:

{0}

A pụghị izochi faịlụ a, ya mere debe ya n'ebe nzuzo. Synix-achịkwa okwuntughe na Discord webhooks nwere ike mkpa ka re-abanye na ọzọ PC.

